                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.001J56/10: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in Costa
                        Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-05-05T17:00:00-04:00">May 5, 1932—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. Your 37, May 4, 11 a.m. You are authorized to participate in inaugural
                    ceremonies.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
